<PolicyLayout
  title="Refund & Delivery Policy"
  eyebrow="REFUNDS &amp; DELIVERY"
  updated="Effective: 24 August 2026"
>
  <h2>Delivery</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Product: <strong>The 65% Rule</strong> — Digital First Edition (PDF) + printable 65% Blueprint.</li>
    <li>Price: <strong>₹199</strong> inclusive of applicable taxes.</li>
    <li>Method: the digital files are emailed to the address you provide at checkout, immediately after your payment is verified by PayU.</li>
    <li>Timing: normally within minutes. If you do not receive the email within <strong>24 hours</strong>, check your spam/promotions folder, then contact us at <a href="mailto:shubhupublication@gmail.com">shubhupublication@gmail.com</a> with your order reference.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Refunds</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Non-delivery:</strong> if we cannot deliver the digital book to the email you provided, you may request a full refund.</li>
    <li><strong>Duplicate charge:</strong> if you are charged twice for the same order, the duplicate payment will be refunded in full once verified.</li>
    <li><strong>After delivery:</strong> because this is a digital product that is delivered instantly, no refund is generally available after the files have been sent, except where required by applicable law (including Indian consumer law).</li>
    <li>Refunds are processed back to the original payment method via PayU and typically appear within 5–10 business days depending on your bank.</li>
  </ul>

  <p>To request a refund, email <a href="mailto:shubhupublication@gmail.com">shubhupublication@gmail.com</a> with your order reference (shown after payment) within 7 days of purchase.</p>
</PolicyLayout>